<section aria-labelledby="nav-h">
  <h2 id="nav-h" class="type-h2">Top nav</h2>
  <p>The header sits at the top of every page and stays with you as you scroll. It has the logo at the left. At the right, below 1024px it has a secondary Menu button, which opens the <a href="/components/menu-overlay/">menu overlay</a>. From 1024px up it has the four links, a divider and the theme toggle instead, and the site name appears beside the logo. The frames below are fixed widths, so each shows its own layout on any screen.</p>
